build123d-cpp
A C++ port of build123d and bd_warehouse, with the material system of
bd_materials and threejs_materials, licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(LICENSE).

It is ported from these projects, each licensed under the Apache License 2.0:

- build123d (https://github.com/gumyr/build123d), by Roger Maitland and its
  contributors: the library, the examples in examples/, and its
  template_render.js as src/template_render.inc.
- bd_warehouse (https://github.com/gumyr/bd_warehouse), by Roger Maitland and
  its contributors: include/bd_warehouse/, src/bd_warehouse/ and its data
  tables.
- bd_materials (https://github.com/bernhard-42/bd_materials),
  Copyright 2026 Bernhard Walter: the material system and its catalog.
- threejs_materials (https://github.com/bernhard-42/threejs-materials),
  Copyright 2025 materialx-lib contributors: the material presets.

Other files it includes have their own licenses:

- the Relief SingleLine CAD font (data/fonts/reliefsingleline/): SIL Open
  Font License 1.1, data/fonts/reliefsingleline/OFL.txt.
- lodepng (third_party/lodepng/): zlib license, third_party/lodepng/LICENSE.
- xxHash (third_party/xxhash/): BSD 2-Clause license, third_party/xxhash/LICENSE.
